// Grounded Brain: Inngest events and background functions
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code. Paste into a new Flow Chart diagram at https://app.eraser.io
title Background jobs (Inngest)
direction right
colorMode bold

// Publishers
SourceService create or reprocess [shape: oval, icon: nodejs, color: green]
SourceService delete [shape: oval, icon: nodejs, color: green]
WorkspaceService delete [shape: oval, icon: nodejs, color: green]
ArtifactService create [shape: oval, icon: nodejs, color: green]
ChatService every 8 messages [shape: oval, icon: nodejs, color: green]

// Events
source/created [shape: parallelogram, icon: zap, color: purple]
source/deleted [shape: parallelogram, icon: zap, color: purple]
workspace/deleted [shape: parallelogram, icon: zap, color: purple]
artifact/generate [shape: parallelogram, icon: zap, color: purple]
conversation/summarize [shape: parallelogram, icon: zap, color: purple]

// Functions
process-source [icon: file-text, color: blue, label: "process-source\nmark-processing → extract-and-chunk → embed-and-index\n3 retries · 1 per sourceId"]
generate-artifact [icon: book-open, color: blue, label: "generate-artifact\ngenerate\n2 retries"]
summarize-conversation [icon: message-square, color: blue, label: "summarize-conversation\nsummarize + Mem0 learning\n2 retries · 1 per conversationId"]

// Downstream
Pinecone [icon: database]
OpenAI [icon: openai]
Postgres [icon: postgres]
Mem0 [icon: brain]

SourceService create or reprocess > source/created > process-source
SourceService delete > source/deleted
WorkspaceService delete > workspace/deleted
ArtifactService create > artifact/generate > generate-artifact
ChatService every 8 messages > conversation/summarize > summarize-conversation

source/deleted --> process-source: cancels
workspace/deleted --> process-source: cancels
workspace/deleted --> generate-artifact: cancels

process-source > OpenAI: embeddings
process-source > Pinecone: vectors
process-source > Postgres: chunks + status
generate-artifact > OpenAI: structured generation
generate-artifact > Postgres: content + status
summarize-conversation > OpenAI: rolling summary
summarize-conversation > Postgres: summary
summarize-conversation > Mem0: learn memories
